  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-1",
   "section": "Career and activism",
   "text": "Adra is an activist and a volunteer photographer for B'Tselem.",
   "words": 11,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    11
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1087363578,
   "revisions": [
    1087363578,
    1087364789,
    1087371276
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    7,
    3,
    1
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-2",
   "section": "Career and activism",
   "text": "He works as journalist for online publications +972 Magazine and Local Call along with photojournalist Oren Ziv, who wrote the +972 Magazine article following the Channel 12 allegations made against al-Adra.",
   "words": 32,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    20,
    12
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1252913577,
   "revisions": [
    1252913577,
    1087364789,
    1252913947,
    1087371276,
    1087371859,
    1252918249
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    16,
    9,
    3,
    2,
    1,
    1
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-3",
   "section": "Career and activism",
   "text": "In 2021, the HaKol HaYehudi and Channel 12 news outlets accused al-Adra of setting fire to a building in the Hebron Hills (the West Bank) claiming that he tried to frame Jewish settlers and Israeli Defence Forces (IDF) soldiers for the incident.",
   "words": 43,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 3",
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 16"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    20,
    17,
    6
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1087367648,
   "revisions": [
    1087367648,
    1252918249,
    1210490528,
    1087371276,
    1252914171
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    16,
    15,
    6,
    4,
    2
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-4",
   "section": "Career and activism",
   "text": "The body camera footage used by Channel 12 instead shows that the fire was caused by a tear gas canister fired by the Israeli army, and al-Adra can be seen trying to put it out.",
   "words": 36,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    36
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1252918249,
   "revisions": [
    1252918249
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    36
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-5",
   "section": "Career and activism",
   "text": "Since then, Channel 12 News and the right-wing media in Israel have failed to provide any evidence to support their claims against al-Adra, and the news channel has said it does not intend to investigate the incident further.",
   "words": 40,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    40
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1252918249,
   "revisions": [
    1252918249
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    40
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-6",
   "section": "Career and activism",
   "text": "In 2022, he was beaten while he was recording the IDF demolishing a structure that he had built, and detained in harsh conditions after filming an attack by an Israeli army security coordinator in 2023.",
   "words": 35,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 4",
    "Editor 3",
    "Editor 5",
    "Editor 8",
    "Editor 21"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    17,
    11,
    5,
    1,
    1
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1277956579,
   "revisions": [
    1277956579,
    1087370337,
    1273113440,
    1087368118,
    1277961234,
    1264007144,
    1278699945
   ],
   "revision_words": [
