   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-1",
   "section": "No Other Land",
   "text": "In February 2024, the film No Other Land about the situation of Masafer Yatta that he co-wrote and co-directed with Israelis Yuval Abraham and Rachel Szor and Palestinian Hamdan Ballal, premiered at the 74th Berlin International Film Festival and won the Berlinale Best Documentary film award and Panorama Audience Award for Best Documentary Film.",
   "words": 56,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 6",
    "Editor 9",
    "Editor 13",
    "Editor 5"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    26,
    16,
